{j} is pronounced as the "j" in "bonjour" (zh). It's rather like humming
while saying the "z" sound.

So, it is pronounced "REEZH-noh".

to pu benji di'u fo lo mi me la.android. fonxa toi

mu'o mi'e.aionys.

